# Zero-setup sync.
#
# Fill these two in and the app syncs for everyone with no key-pasting at all:
# sign up once on the laptop, sign in with the same user ID on the phone, and the
# tasks are there. See supabase/schema.sql for the one-time database setup.
#
# The anon key is public by design — row-level security in Postgres is what stops
# one user reading another user's row. Never put a service_role key here.
#
# Leave both blank to keep the planner purely local; people can still connect a
# project by hand in Settings -> Account (or during onboarding).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
